  "description": "Powerful Motor & TüV-Certified Safety\nThe BK10S features a 250W 70Nm hub motor and a reliable 48V 13Ah (624Wh) lithium battery for confident performance in the city or off-road. With CE and TüV certifications, this e-bike meets European safety standards, giving you extra peace of mind. Enjoy up to 120 km of assisted riding — ideal for commuting, day trips, or weekend rides.\nSmart LCD Display with Bluetooth APP & Street-Ready Features\nThe upgraded LCD smart display shows real-time speed, battery level, and distance, and even supports Bluetooth connectivity with an APP for tracking your rides and adjusting settings. With IP54 water resistance, StVZO-certified LED lights, and CE/TüV certification, the BK10S is ready for both your adventures and your daily commute.\n20\" Fat Tires & Suspension Fork for All-Terrain Comfort\nTackle snow, sand, gravel, or urban streets with ease thanks to the 20×4.0 inch anti-slip pneumatic tires and front suspension fork. These features offer better grip and shock absorption, turning even bumpy roads into smooth rides.\nFoldable Design & Rear Cargo Rack\nThe folding frame makes the BK10S ideal for limited spaces – store it in your SUV, camper van, boat, or hallway. The rear cargo rack adds daily convenience, allowing you to carry groceries, backpacks, or work essentials with ease.\nShimano 7-Speed & Dual Disc Brakes\nShift through gears smoothly with the Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, while front and rear mechanical disc brakes offer reliable stopping power – even on descents or in wet conditions. Designed for both performance and safety.",
